Subject: [PATCH 1/2] Schemas for the merge manager rulings: lane holding on a
 role, and the six-line merge request

Owner rulings, 2026-11-07 ("make sure to update schemas"):
- role-graph.ts: optional strict holding on a role (neededWhen, election,
  loneSessionHolds, announce), with laneNeeded() reading the measured
  condition and electHolder() choosing the holder deterministically
  (P0 owner, else earliest-created, then session id).
- merge-queue.ts: MergeRequestSchema, formatMergeRequest and
  parseMergeRequest for the six-line request (PR URL and head SHA, session
  URL, 1-3 sentences, rendered preview or a reason, what to look for, full
  tier green as judged).
- Tests for both.

